  "description": "Mr. Ju’s thirst for women is never ending. Morning, noon, or night, any time of the day is a welcome opportunity to whet his appetite. However, his father, the chairman, has finally had enough. He’s hired a new secretary to whip Mr. Ju into shape and hopefully get him to take his job more seriously. Ms. Kang is all business and has quite a skillset. However, there is far more to Ms. Kang than meets the eye. Mr. Ju and Ms. Kang are about to get entangled in affairs they could never have predicted…\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
